    "description": "Sheaffer\nBallpoint Pen and Mechanical Pencil Set - Pepsi Advertising Edition\n1980s Era, Black Matte Finish with Gold-Tone Trim\nThis vintage Sheaffer writing set represents a classic piece of 1980s corporate advertising history, featuring the iconic Pepsi \"Choice of a New Generation\" branding. The set consists of a ballpoint pen and a mechanical pencil, both finished in a professional matte black with elegant gold-tone hardware. As a collaborative piece, it combines Sheaffer's mid-century reputation for reliable writing instruments with the bold marketing aesthetic of one of the world's most recognizable beverage brands.\nMatte black barrel construction with contrasting gold-tone clips and decorative bands\nCustom Pepsi globe logo emblems mounted on the pocket clips\n\"PEPSI. THE CHOICE OF A NEW GENERATION.\" printed in gold-tone script on the pen barrel\nEach instrument measures 5\" in length and includes the original Sheaffer presentation box\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. The matte black finish is well-preserved with only minor surface handling marks. The gold-tone trim remains bright, and the Pepsi logo inserts are intact with vibrant color. The mechanical components of both the pen and pencil are functional. No testing has been performed on the ink supply or lead capacity. The original box is included and shows light storage wear.",
